    "payers_note": "LynkOmni never pays for a check (owner, 2026-11-26). partner: the licensed partner of that service checks identity as part of its own legal duty, at its own cost, and LynkOmni only asks for its answer. requester: the employer, landlord or election organiser who asks for the check pays the network or identity partner, at that partner's price shown before they agree, or inside their plan. The person being checked never pays. Getting back into an account uses the free ways of the Can't sign in? hub, never a paid check."
  },
  "free_first": {
    "rule": "LynkOmni uses the free ways the big platforms use: passkeys and security keys, approving on a signed-in device, QR sign-in, authenticator apps, backup and recovery codes, and codes by email. A text is used only where it is truly needed (owner, 2026-11-26).",
